WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:02.544
I have spent my life

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.004
trying to protect my family.

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:06.131
The battle begins today.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:08.008
♪♪

00:00:09.051 --> 00:00:12.095
♪♪

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.854
Do you remember
what it felt like

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.064
to live in peace?

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.358
The world has changed.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:29.196
♪♪

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:30.614
This new weapon,

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:32.157
more powerful
than you can imagine.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:34.952
It will kill thousands.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:36.954
They'll fight...

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:37.955
Just death.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:39.414
Fire!

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.339
♪♪

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:48.173
My queen,

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.550
the Trivantians now can
destroy entire cities.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:55.097
All of Paya

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:56.765
will be ours.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.142
We now have the greatest

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.395
weapon this world
has ever known.

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:03.397
No religion will stop it.

00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:05.482
War is quite
an elegant solution.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.859
I am your queen!

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:10.779
♪♪

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:13.532
My sister hunted
us for 17 years,

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:14.866
and she won't stop now.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.120
I will die before I
allow anything happen to you,

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.538
or to our children.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:22.708
♪♪

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.128
I never had to
fight for my crown.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:29.214
Now that crown will
be forced into the

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:31.049
burning flames of war.

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.386
♪♪

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:37.931
I will be a queen of war.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.934
♪♪

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:46.898
You know in your heart

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:47.733
what needs to be done.

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.361
♪♪

00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:53.822
Hit them again.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:55.741
♪♪

00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:56.742
This moment,

00:01:58.035 --> 00:02:00.037
this is the moment for
which you were born.

00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:09.087
♪♪

